 <h3><u>Bibi masooma e qum</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ek bacchi Jo thi moosiye kaazim ke dilka chayn,<br> Har eid pe karti thi musalle pe jaake bayn</p> 
  <p>1) Karthi hai rabse dua , ay shahe uqda kusha (haaye baba jaan ),<br> Abke baras eid pe , aaiye behre khuda ,<br> Baap kabhi bêtise hote nahi yu juda - (2)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;<br> Bibi masooma- e - qum ka tha ye nouha ,<br> Kya abke baras aaoge baba</p> 
  <p>2) 14 baras aapke qaide sitam me Kate (haaye baba jaan)<br> Qaid bhi aisi jahan aap rukoo me rahe ,<br> Aur yahan mere lab maaile fariyad the - (2)<br> My yahan aap wahan karte hai nouha.....<br> Kya abke baras aaoge baba</p> 
  <p>3) Logo se maine suna aisi hai qaide jafa&nbsp;&nbsp; (haaye baba jaan) ,<br> Gairo ke zanjeer bhi padthi rahe marsiya ,<br> Waqt ki zanjeer ne qaid mujhe bhi kiya - (2) ,<br> Maine paigaam hawavon se ye bheja......<br> Kya abke baras aaoge baba</p> 
  <p>4) Qaid ki taarikiyaa'n qaid ke tanhaiyaa'n (haaye baba jaan) ,<br> Meri tarha raat din karti hai tum par fugha'n ,<br> Dono hai zindaan me Aap wahan mai yaha'n-(2),<br> Ye batao ke mujhe dene dilasa...<br> Kya abke baras aaoge baba</p> 
  <p>5) Uth gaya tera padar maine suni jab khabar (haaye baba jaan)<br> Tooti umeedein meri qalb hua nouha gar ,<br> Kohe sitam gir pada dukhtare mazloom par -(2) ,<br> Rehgaya phir bhi fazavon me ye nouha....<br> Kya abke baras aaoge baba</p> 
  <p>6) Tang hai mujh par zameen zapt ka yaara nahi ( haaye baba jaan )<br> Aur ye furqat ka gum aur ye qalbe hazee ,<br> Aap nahi aayenge kya mai ye karlu yaqee -(2)<br> Nouha din raat yahi karti hoon baba...</p> 
  <p>Kya abke baras aaoge baba..</p> 
  <p>7) Zakhmi kaleja mera karta rahega buka (haaye baba jaan)<br> Ab to chale aaiye aagayi sar par qaza ,<br> Zebe musalla hu mai sunlo meri ilteja -(2) ,<br> Baba bin aapke bekaar hai jeena...<br> Kya ab ke baras aaoge baba..</p> 
  <p>8) Bibi ka ye marsiya mazhar-o-irfan ka ,<br> Gum ye kisi beti ko ab na dikhaye khuda ,<br> Maine sahe hai jo gum jaanta hai dil mera -(2) ,<br> Ek misra hai masayib ka sahifa....<br> Kya abke baras aaoge baba</p> 
  <p>Bibi masooma - e - qum ka tha ye nouha<br> Kya abke baras aaoge baba -(3)...</p> 
